{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2025 Update: Massive Galaxy restarted development so expect some news next year!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive Galaxy combines classic point and click gameplay with space trading, turn-based combat and galactic exploration in an immersive pixel-art world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785050/extras/586a3ab3e62be3b69484f6aed75c1f3d.avif?t=1763552576\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to distant planets full of rich and diverse cultures, investigate technologically advanced space habitats and uncover the history and lore of ancient civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785050/extras/76958f90f9bc843f6eeb6be47f75a4e7.poster.avif?t=1763552576\" width=614 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785050/extras/76958f90f9bc843f6eeb6be47f75a4e7.webm?t=1763552576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785050/extras/76958f90f9bc843f6eeb6be47f75a4e7.mp4?t=1763552576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a space-trader seeking to turn a profit by buying and selling goods throughout the galaxy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undertake routine missions or embark on ethically questionable jobs for a quick-buck. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade in densely populated cities, harsh wastelands and discover rare alien artifacts and ships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785050/extras/4574c86340ab6d4985b8400eca018051.avif?t=1763552576\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point and click narrative adventure with a highly stylized retro-vibe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of planets, space stations and habitats to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade and work as a smuggler, courier, spy or just be a space-pirate!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet several space faring alien civilizations, explore the fauna and flora of uncharted planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synth-laden soundtrack</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/785050?t=1763552576","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785050/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763552576","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785050/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763552576","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785050/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763552576","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2025 Update: Massive Galaxy restarted development so expect some news next year!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive Galaxy combines classic point and click gameplay with space trading, turn-based combat and galactic exploration in an immersive pixel-art world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785050/extras/586a3ab3e62be3b69484f6ae